{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827703970725941","content":"The top of the cave is covered in a white congealing mass of viscous liquid.The floor is a mess of brown slime that seems thick with gristle and hair. A strong scent of rancid fat, and rotting pork permeates the air. It is moist, cloying and thick. Your lungs feel coated (though not harmfully so) but you are awkwardly aware with each passing breath that this is already inside you.","created_at":"2020-08-09T01:36:37.678000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741832278107488307","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
